# src/apps/android/app/src/main/java/com/luminet/android/importing

## Purpose
Handles Android-side import of LumiNet configuration and user-provided configuration artifacts.

## Contents
Contains parsers, import models, validation helpers, and application-facing import coordination code.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Receives external/user-controlled input and feeds validated configuration into Android application state or shared contracts.

## Invariants
Imported data is untrusted until validated, malformed input must fail without partial mutation, and successful imports must preserve documented configuration semantics.